# {{lb|en|artificial intelligence}} A [[real]] or [[virtual]] [[computer]] [[system]] designed to [[emulate]] the [[brain]] in its [[ability]] to "[[learn]]" to [[assess]] [[imprecise]] [[data]].
# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Any network of [[neuron]]s etc that [[function]] [[together]] to achieve a common purpose.

